### RentACar — örnek OData istekleri
### VS Code "REST Client" eklentisi (humao.rest-client) ile her isteğin üstündeki "Send Request"e tıkla.
### Önce: npm run db:up, npm run watch
### Kullanıcı: Aşama 4'e kadar yetki yok; draft işlemleri için CAP'in hazır mock kullanıcısı "alice" kullanılıyor.

@server = http://localhost:4004
@auth = Basic alice:

############################################################
# 1) Servis meta verisi (EDMX): entity'ler, alanlar, anotasyonlar
############################################################

### RentalService $metadata
GET {{server}}/rental/$metadata

### AdminService $metadata
GET {{server}}/admin/$metadata

############################################################
# 2) Sorgu seçenekleri (query options)
############################################################

### Açık kiralamalar: $filter + $select + $expand + $orderby
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals
  ?$filter=status_code eq 'O'
  &$select=rentalID,pickupDate,returnDate,totalPrice
  &$expand=customer($select=fullName),vehicle($select=plate,brand,model)
  &$orderby=pickupDate

### Tek kiralama + ek hizmetleri (composition) + Türkçe statü adı
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID=b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005,IsActiveEntity=true)
  ?$expand=status($select=name,criticality),extras($expand=extra($select=name))
  &sap-locale=tr

### Sayfalama ve toplam sayı: $top + $skip + $count
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals?$select=rentalID,totalPrice&$orderby=rentalID&$top=5&$skip=5&$count=true

### Lambda filtresi: GPS ek hizmeti içeren kiralamaların sayısı
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals/$count?$filter=extras/any(e:e/extra_code eq 'GPS')

### Müsait SUV'lar (araç value help'inin yapacağı sorgu)
GET {{server}}/rental/Vehicles
  ?$filter=status_code eq 'AV' and category_code eq 'SUV'
  &$select=plate,brand,model,dailyRate
  &$expand=fuelType($select=name),transmission($select=name)
  &sap-locale=tr

### Serbest metin araması ($search)
GET {{server}}/rental/Customers?$search=Yılmaz&$select=fullName,email,city

### Kod listesi, İngilizce
GET {{server}}/rental/RentalStatus?sap-locale=en

############################################################
# 3) Draft akışı: oluştur → güncelle → aktive et
############################################################

### a) Yeni taslak oluştur (IsActiveEntity=false döner)
# @name newDraft
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### b) Taslağın yönetim bilgileri (kim oluşturdu, kim kilitliyor)
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/DraftAdministrativeData
Authorization: {{auth}}

### c) Taslağı güncelle (her alan değişikliği bir PATCH)
PATCH {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_ID": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "vehicle_ID": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "pickupBranch_code": "ANK-CEN",
  "returnBranch_code": "ANK-CEN",
  "pickupDate": "2026-12-01",
  "returnDate": "2026-12-04"
}

### d) Taslağa ek hizmet ekle (composition içine POST)
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/extras
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "extra_code": "GPS", "quantity": 1 }

### e) Kaydet = draftActivate (taslak ana tabloya taşınır)
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/RentalService.draftActivate
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### f) Aktif kaydı düzenlemeye aç = draftEdit
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RentalService.draftEdit
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "PreserveChanges": true }

### g) Vazgeç = taslağı sil (aktif kayıt değişmeden kalır)
DELETE {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: {{auth}}

### h) Denemeyi temizle: aktif kaydı sil
DELETE {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=true)
Authorization: {{auth}}

############################################################
# 4) Salt okunur ve yönetim servisi
############################################################

### RentalService'te araçlar salt okunur → 405 ENTITY_IS_READ_ONLY
PATCH {{server}}/rental/Vehicles(a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dailyRate": 1 }

### AdminService: araç listesi
GET {{server}}/admin/Vehicles?$select=plate,brand,model,status_code&$filter=status_code eq 'MT'
